### Restaurant order program

This Python program simulates a restaurant ordering system. It displays a restaurant menu with food items and their prices (in USD), allows customers to place orders, and calculates the total cost of the order.

Features

Displays a menu with food items and their prices.

Accepts customer orders.

Validates whether the ordered item is on the menu.

Adds valid items to the order.

Prompts the customer to order something else if an item is not available.

Calculates and displays the total price of the ordered food.
